onsume energía adicional y ejecuta un poderoso ataque subsiguiente contra los enemigos frente a ella, infligiendo una gran cantidad de daño gélido.\nDurante su ejecución, obtiene 2 cargas de cencellada.\nDurante su ejecución, la agente se vuelve invulnerable."}],"atributos":[{"clave":"Técnica especial: Beldad nívea","valores":["Nivel 1","Nivel 2","Nivel 3","Nivel 4","Nivel 5","Nivel 6","Nivel 7","Nivel 8","Nivel 9","Nivel 10","Nivel 11","Nivel 12","Nivel 13","Nivel 14","Nivel 15","Nivel 16"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de daño","valores":["35.8%","39.1%","42.4%","45.7%","49%","52.3%","55.6%","58.9%","62.2%","65.5%","68.8%","72.1%","75.4%","78.7%","82%","85.3%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento","valores":["35.8%","37.5%","39.2%","40.9%","42.6%","44.3%","46%","47.7%","49.4%","51%","52.8%","54.5%","56.2%","57.9%","59.6%","61.3%"]},{"clave":"","valores":["","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]},{"clave":"Técnica especial EX: Viento blanco","valores":["Nivel 1","Nivel 2","Nivel 3","Nivel 4","Nivel 5","Nivel 6","Nivel 7","Nivel 8","Nivel 9","Nivel 10","Nivel 11","Nivel 12","Nivel 13","Nivel 14","Nivel 15","Nivel 16"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de daño de corte","valores":["393.4%","429.3%","465.2%","501.1%","537%","572.9%","608.8%","644.7%","680.6%","716.5%","752.4%","788.3%","824.2%","860.1%","896%","931.9%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de daño\ndel ataque subsiguiente","valores":["483.2%","527.2%","571.2%","615.2%","659.2%","703.2%","747.2%","791.2%","835.2%","879.2%","923.2%","967.2%","1011.2%","1055.2%","1099.2%","1143.2%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento\ndel ataque","valores":["321.7%","336.4%","351.1%","365.8%","380.5%","395.2%","409.9%","424.6%","439.3%","454%","468.7%","483.4%","498.1%","512.8%","527.5%","542.2%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento\ndel ataque subsiguiente","valores":["405%","423.5%","442%","460.5%","479%","497.5%","516%","534.5%","553%","571.5%","590%","608.5%","627%","645.5%","664%","682.5%"]},{"clave":"Consumo de energ